        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: 2003 Hawaii Warriors football team, Houston Cougars\n- People: June Jones\n- Organizations: University of Hawaii at Manoa, Hamilton Tiger-Cats, Canadian Football League\n- Events: 2003 NCAA Division I-A football season, 2003 Sheraton Hawaii Bowl\n\nFacts:\n- The 2003 Hawaii Warriors football team represented the University of Hawaii at Manoa in the 2003 NCAA Division I-A football season.\n- In 2003, the Hawaii Warriors completed their second straight winning season and their fourth winning season in five years under head coach June Jones.\n- In 2003, the Hawaii Warriors ended their season with a bowl win.\n- The 2003 Sheraton Hawaii Bowl matched the hometown Hawaii Warriors against the Houston Cougars.\n- June Sheldon Jones III was born on February 19, 1953.\n- June Jones is an American football coach and former player.\n- June Jones served as head coach of the Hamilton Tiger-Cats of the Canadian Football League.",
